<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $365,000 Czech ATP tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Marcos Aurelio Gorriz (Spain) beat Oliver Gross (Germany) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Marcell Craca (Germany) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Cedric Pioline (France) beat Karel Kucera (Slovakia) 7-5 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell (Spain) beat 6-Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Lionel Roux (France) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat 7-Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Thierry Champion (France) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Orlin Stanoichev (Bulgaria) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
